# FeedbackApp

## About the Project

FeedbackApp is a simple Java Servlet application
created to collect feedback from users.

Users can enter their name and email, select a
feedback type, and write their comments.

After submitting the form, the application displays
the entered details along with a thank-you message
and the current date and time.

## Technologies Used
- HTML
- Java
- Java Servlet
- XML
- Apache Tomcat

## How to Run
1. Open the project in Eclipse IDE.
2. Configure Apache Tomcat 9.
3. Add FeedbackApp to the Tomcat server.
4. Start the server.
5. Open the browser and visit:

   http://localhost:8080/FeedbackApp/feedback.html

6. Fill in the feedback form and click Submit Feedback.

## Project Files
- feedback.html
- FeedbackServlet.java
- web.xml

## Conclusion

Through this project, I learned how to create an
HTML form, connect it to a Java Servlet, and display
the submitted information using a web application.